  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>trajectory-resample-samples · 6×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1536 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-encounters-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"81\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"4\"></rect><rect x=\"101\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"5\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-encounters-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const trackOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; trackOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const timestampsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; timestamps: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const clockParametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; clockParameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const samplesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; samples: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 771u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const SAMPLE_COUNT: u32 = 120u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn getRowTimeDifference(a: u32, b: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  return timestamps[timestampsOffset + a] - timestamps[timestampsOffset + b];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn getClockOffset(firstRow: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  return clockParameters[clockParametersOffset] - timestamps[timestampsOffset + firstRow];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">fn getClockStep() -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  return clockParameters[clockParametersOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">fn interpolatePosition(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, fraction: f32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  return select(a + (b - a) * fraction, b, fraction &gt;= 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">fn getSegmentLength(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  return length(b - a);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">fn getSegmentHeading(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  let delta = b - a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  return select(0.0, atan2(delta.y, delta.x), delta.x != 0.0 || delta.y != 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">fn getProgress(row: u32, firstRow: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  return getRowTimeDifference(row, firstRow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"52\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"53\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  _ = &amp;trackOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  _ = &amp;timestamps;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  _ = &amp;clockParameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  _ = &amp;samples;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let track = index / SAMPLE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let sampleIndex = index - track * SAMPLE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let trackStart = min(trackOffsets[trackOffsetsOffset + track], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  let trackEnd = clamp(trackOffsets[trackOffsetsOffset + track + 1u], trackStart, ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  var position = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0, 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  var elevation = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  var time = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let clockStep = getClockStep();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  var isAbsent = trackEnd &lt;= trackStart;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  if (trackEnd &gt; trackStart) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    let lastRow = trackEnd - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    let total = getProgress(lastRow, trackStart);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    var targetProgress = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    targetProgress = getClockOffset(trackStart) + f32(sampleIndex) * clockStep;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">    isAbsent = !(targetProgress &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; targetProgress &lt;= total);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">    if (false) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">      targetProgress = select(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">        total * (f32(sampleIndex) / f32(SAMPLE_COUNT - 1u)),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">        total,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">        sampleIndex == SAMPLE_COUNT - 1u\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">      );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    var low = trackStart + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    var high = trackEnd;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      if (low &gt;= high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">        break;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">      if (getProgress(middle, trackStart) &gt; targetProgress) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">        high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">        low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">    // Past the last row: the end of the last segment, so a great-circle track keeps its longitude\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">    // continuous across the antimeridian (planar: exactly the last row).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">    var row0 = select(lastRow, lastRow - 1u, lastRow &gt; trackStart);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">    var row1 = lastRow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">    var fraction = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">    if (low &lt; trackEnd) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">      row0 = low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">      row1 = low;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">      let startProgress = getProgress(row0, trackStart);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">      fraction = clamp(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">        (targetProgress - startProgress) / (getProgress(row1, trackStart) - startProgress),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">        0.0,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">        1.0\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">      );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">    let startPosition = getPosition(row0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">    let endPosition = getPosition(row1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    position = interpolatePosition(startPosition, endPosition, fraction);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">    \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  if (isAbsent) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">    // A runtime expression keeps the quiet-NaN bit pattern out of const evaluation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    position = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    elevation = position.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  samples[samplesOffset + 2u * index] = position.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  samples[samplesOffset + 2u * index + 1u] = position.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  _ = elevation;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  _ = time;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>trackOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"trackOffsets\">trackOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>timestamps<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"timestamps\">timestamps</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>clockParameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"clock\">clock</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>samples<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"clockSamples\">clockSamples</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUTrajectoryResample/clock · main · 73a115ab</figcaption></figure></section>",
